tyle=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">2. </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:13.0pt;\">안전한 청소년활동의 확산 및 안전의식을 제고를 위한 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">‘</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:13.0pt;\">청소년활동 안전 온택트</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">(Ontact) </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:13.0pt;\">홍보단</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">’</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:13.0pt;\">을 아래와 모집하오니 많은 관심과 참여 바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:13.0pt;\"></span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:13.0pt;\">&nbsp;가</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:13.0pt;\">모집개요</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;mso-hansi-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;ㅇ </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:13.0pt;\">모집기간</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">: 2021. 6. 11.(</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:13.0pt;\">금</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">) ~ 6.25.(</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:13.0pt;\">금</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">), 16:00</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:13.0pt;\">까지</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;mso-hansi-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;ㅇ </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:13.0pt;\">모집대상</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:13.0pt;\">청소년</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">(15</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:13.0pt;\">세</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">~24</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:13.0pt;\">세</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">) </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:13.0pt;\">및 일반국민</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;mso-hansi-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;ㅇ </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:13.0pt;\">모집구성</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">: 1</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:13.0pt;\">인 또는 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">4</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:13.0pt;\">인 이하로 구성된 팀</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:13.0pt;\">총 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">20</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:13.0pt;\">팀 이내