o-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">·</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:13.0pt;\">시설 안전</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:13.0pt;\">교통안전</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;mso-hansi-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;ㅇ </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:13.0pt;\">활동내용</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:13.0pt;\">분야별 홍보영상 및 시각자료 콘텐츠 제작</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">, SNS</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:13.0pt;\">를 통한 온라인 홍보활동 등</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:13.0pt;\"></span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:13.0pt;\">&nbsp;나</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:13.0pt;\">지원내용</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;mso-hansi-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;ㅇ </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:13.0pt;\">지원규모</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">: (1</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:13.0pt;\">인</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">)1,000</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:13.0pt;\">천원</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">~2,000</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:13.0pt;\">천원 이내</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">, (</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:13.0pt;\">팀</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">)2,000</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:13.0pt;\">천원 이상</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">~3,000</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:13.0pt;\">천원 이내</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;mso-hansi-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;ㅇ </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:13.0pt;\">지원방식</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:13.0pt;\">홍보단 선정 후 대표자 통장으로 사업비 교부 및 정산</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:13.0pt;\">별도 통장 개설</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;mso-hansi-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; ※ </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:13.0pt;\">홍보단 전원 활동 증명서 발급</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:13.0pt;\">우수 홍보단 시상 예정</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:13.0pt;\">여성가족부 장관 및 진흥원 이사장상</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:13.0pt;\"></span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:13.0pt;\">&nbsp;다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:13.0pt;\">신청방법</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:13.0pt;\">진흥원 대표 홈페이지 내 공지사항 참고&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:13.0pt;\"></span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:13.0pt;\">&nbsp;라</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:13.0pt;\">결과발표</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">: 2021. 7. 2.(</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:13.0pt;\">금</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">) </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:13.0pt;\">진흥원 홈페이지 내 공지 예정&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:13.0pt;\"></span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:13.0pt;\">&nbsp;마</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:13.0pt;\">문 의 처</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:13.0pt;\">활동안전본부 활동안전부 강정현 대리</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">(02-6959-7123, kjh891207@kywa.or.kr)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;mso-hansi-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;※ </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:13.0pt;\">진흥원 홈페이지 공지사항 확인</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">: <a href=\"https://bit.ly/3znKvYt\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"tx-link\">https://bit.ly/3znKvYt</a></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"></p><div id=\"hwpEditorBoardContent\" class=\"hwp_editor_board_content\" data-hjsonver=\"1.0\" data-jsonlen=\"14719\"><!--[data-hwpjson]{\n\"documentPr\": {\n\"di\": \"\",\n\"dp\": {\n\"dn\": \"test.hwp\",\n\"ta\": 1,\n\"d1\": 5,\n\"d2\": 0,\n\"dv\": 5,\n\"dr\": 1,\n\"do\": 1,\n\"vj\": \"1.0\",\n\"an\": \"Hancom Office Hangul\",\n\"av\": \"9, 1, 1, 5391\",\n\"ao\": \"WIN\",\n\"ab\": \"32\",\n\"ar\": \"LE\",\n\"as\": \"Windows_Unknown_Version\"\n},\n\"dis\": false,\n\"ds\": {\n\"ti\": \"\",\n\"la\": \"ko\",\n\"cr\": \"\",\n\"su